#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.groupby.LiteFrameGroupBy.transform_chunk.rst:2
msgid "maxframe.liteframe.groupby.LiteFrameGroupBy.transform\\_chunk"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.functional.transform_chunk.groupby_transform_chunk:1 of
msgid "GroupBy.transform_chunk() -- per-group-chunk transform."
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.functional.transform_chunk.groupby_transform_chunk:3 of
msgid ""
"Applies ``func`` to each group's execution chunk independently.  As with "
"the ungrouped ``transform_chunk``, the output row count must match the "
"input (transform semantics)."
msgstr ""
"独立地将 ``func`` 应用于每个组的执行块。与未分组的 ``transform_chunk`` "
"一样，输出行数必须与输入匹配（变换语义）。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.functional.transform_chunk.groupby_transform_chunk of
msgid "参数"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.functional.transform_chunk.groupby_transform_chunk:7 of
msgid ""
"Function taking a per-group DataFrame chunk and returning a DataFrame "
"with the same number of rows.  If ``func`` is a class, it is instantiated"
" once per group and ``close()`` (if defined) is always called at the end "
"of each group."
msgstr ""
"接收每个组的 DataFrame 块并返回具有相同行数的 DataFrame 的函数。如果 ``"
"func`` 是一个类，则每个组实例化一次，并且始终在每个组结束时调用 ``close()"
"``（如果已定义）。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.functional.transform_chunk.groupby_transform_chunk:14 of
msgid "Expected output dtypes."
msgstr "期望的输出数据类型。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.functional.transform_chunk.groupby_transform_chunk:16 of
msgid "If True, skip dtype inference."
msgstr "如果为 True，则跳过数据类型推断。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.functional.transform_chunk.groupby_transform_chunk:18 of
msgid "Frame type passed to ``func``."
msgstr "传递给 ``func`` 的框架类型。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.functional.transform_chunk.groupby_transform_chunk:20 of
msgid "Extra positional arguments forwarded to ``func``."
msgstr "转发给 ``func`` 的额外位置参数。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.functional.transform_chunk.groupby_transform_chunk:22 of
msgid "Extra keyword arguments forwarded to ``func``."
msgstr "转发给 ``func`` 的额外关键字参数。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.functional.transform_chunk.groupby_transform_chunk of
msgid "返回"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.functional.transform_chunk.groupby_transform_chunk:24 of
msgid ""
"Lazy LiteFrame with the same row count as the input, where each value is "
"the per-group transform result.  Call ``.execute()`` to materialize."
msgstr ""
"惰性 LiteFrame，具有与输入相同的行数，其中每个值都是按组变换的结果。调用 "
"``.execute()`` 来实例化。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.functional.transform_chunk.groupby_transform_chunk of
msgid "返回类型"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.functional.transform_chunk.groupby_transform_chunk:31 of
msgid ":py:obj:`groupby_transform`"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.functional.transform_chunk.groupby_transform_chunk:32 of
msgid "Per-group column transform."
msgstr "按组列变换。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.functional.transform_chunk.groupby_transform_chunk:34 of
msgid ":py:obj:`groupby_apply_chunk`"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.functional.transform_chunk.groupby_transform_chunk:35 of
msgid "Per-group-chunk application."
msgstr "按组块应用。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.functional.transform_chunk.groupby_transform_chunk:38 of
msgid "示例"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.functional.transform_chunk.groupby_transform_chunk:42 of
msgid "Scale each group's chunk by 2 (row count preserved):"
msgstr "将每个组的块按 2 缩放（保留行数）："

